hadiths[65]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1368","It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:n The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: 'We are the last (to come) but will be the foremost on the Day of Resurrection, but they were given the Book before us and we were given it after them. They differed concerning this day which Allah (SWT), the Mighty and Sublime, had prescribed for them and Allah (SWT), the Mighty and Sublime, guided us to --meaning Friday-- so the people follow us, the Jews the next day and the Christians the day after that.' nSunnan e Nisai Hadees: 1368 Arabic Hadees: 1368"
"1369","It was narrated that Hudhaifah said:n The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: 'Allah (SWT) sent astray from Friday those who came before us, so the Jews had Saturday and the Christians had Sunday. Then Allah (SWT), the Mighty and Sublime, brought us and guided us to Friday, so there is Friday, Saturday and Sunday, and thus they will follow us on the Day of Resurrection. We are the last of the people of this world but the first on the Day of Resurrection for whom judgment will be passed before all other creatures.' nSunnan e Nisai Hadees: 1369 Arabic Hadees: 1369"
"1370","It was narrated from Al-Hakam bin Mina' that:He heard Ibn Abbas and Ibn Umar narrate that while he was on the minbar"
"1371","It was narrated from Hafsah, the wife of the Prophet (ﷺ) that: The Prophet (ﷺ) said: \Going to Jumu'ah is obligatory for everyone who has reached the age of puberty.'\"""""
"1372","It was narrated from Hafsah, the wife of the Prophet (ﷺ) that:nThe Prophet (ﷺ) said: Going to jumu'ah is obligatory for everyone who has reached the age of puberty.' nSunnan e Nisai Hadees: 1372 Arabic Hadees: 1372"
"1373","Abdur-Rahman Al-A'raj narrated that:He heard Abu Hurairah say: \\""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: 'The best day on which the sun rises is Friday. On this day"""
"1374","It was narrated from Aws bin Aws that :The Prophet (ﷺ) said: \\""One of the best of your days is Friday. On this day"""
"1375","It was narrated (through two chains) from 'Abdur-Rahman bin Abi Sa'eed, from his father, that:The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: ""Ghusl and using siwak on Fridays are obligatory for everyone who has reached the age of puberty, and he should put on whatever he can find of perfume."" Except that Bukair (one of the narrators in one chain) did not mention 'Abdur-Rahman, and about the perfume he said: ""Even if it is women's perfume"
"1376","It was narrated from Ibn 'Umar that:The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \\""When any one of you wants to come to Jumu'ah prayer"""
"1377","It was narrated from Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri that:The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \\""Ghusl on Friday is obligatory for everyone who has reached the age of puberty"""
"1378","It was narrated that Jabir said:\\""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: 'Every Muslim man has to perform Ghusl one day in every seven"""
"1379","Abdullah bin Al-'Ala narrated that:He heard Al-Qasim bin Muhammad bin Abi Bakr (say) that they mentioned Ghusl on Fridays in the presence of 'Aishah and she said: \\""Some people used to live in Al-'Aliyah and they would come to Jumu'ah with dirt on them (because of their work). When a breeze came it would carry their smell to the people which annoyed them. Mention of that was made to the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) and he said: \""\""Why don't you perform Ghusl?"""
"1380","It was narrated that Samurah said:\\""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: 'Whoever performs wudu' on Friday"""
"1381","It was narrated from Aws bin Aws that:The Prophet (ﷺ) said: \\""Whoever washes (Ghassala) and performs Ghusl"""
"1382","It was narrated from 'Abdullah bin 'Umar that :'Umar bin al-Khattab saw a Hullah and said: \\""O Messenger of Allah (ﷺ)"""
"1383","It was narrated from 'Abdur-Rahman bin Abi Sa'eed, from his father, that:The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \Ghusl should be performed on Friday by everyone who has reached the age of puberty"
"1384","Abu Al-Ash'ath narrated that:He heard Aws bin Aws, the Companion of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) say: \The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: 'Whoever performs Ghusl on Friday and washes (Ghassala)"
"1385","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that:The Prophet (ﷺ) said: \\""When Friday comes"""
"1386","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah, who was attributing it to the Prophet (ﷺ):""When Friday comes, at every gate of the masjid there are angels who write down the people's names in the order in which they come, then when the Imam comes out, they roll up the scrolls and listen to the Khutbah. The one who comes early to the prayer is like the one who sacrifices a camel, then the one who comes after him is like the one who sacrifices a cow, then the one who comes after him is like the one who sacrifices a ram"" until he mentioned a chicken and an egg"
"1387","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that:The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \\""On Fridays the angels sit at the gates of the Masjid writing down the peoples' names in the order in which they come. So the people are like a man who sacrifices a camel and like a man who sacrifices a camel"""
"1388","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that:The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \\""Whoever performs Ghusl as from Janabah on Friday"""
"1389","It was narrated from Jabir bin 'Abdullah that:The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \\""Friday is twelve hours in which there is no Muslim slave who asks Allah (SWT) for something but He will give it to him"""
"1390","It was narrated that Ja'far bin Muhammad from his father, from Jabir bin 'Abdullah who said:\We used to pray Jumu'ah with the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) then we would go back and tend to our camels.\"" I said: \"" At what time?\"" He said: \""When the sun had passed its zenith.\"""""
"1391","Iyas bin Salamah bin Al-Akwa' narrated that his father said:\\""We used to pray Jumu'ah with the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) then we would go back"""
"1392","As-Sa'ib bin Yazid narrated that:The first Adhan used to be when the Imam sat on the Minbar on Friday"
"1393","As-Sa'ib bin Yazid said:\\""The third Adhan was ordered by 'Uthman when the number of people in Al-Madinah increased. The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) only had one Adhan"""
"1394","It was narrated that As-Sa'ib bin Yazid said:\\""Bilal used to call the Adhan when the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) sat on the Minbar on Friday"""
"1395","It was narrated that 'Amr bin Dinar said:\\""I heard Jabir bin 'Abdullah say: 'The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \""\""If any one of you comes and the Imam has appeared"""
"1396","Jabir bin 'Abdullah said:\\""When the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) delivered the khutbah"""
"1397","It was narrated that Ka'b bin 'Ujrah said that:He entered the masjid and 'Abdur-Rahman bin Umm Al-Hakam was delivering the Khutbah while seated. \\""He said: 'Look at this man who is delivering the khutbah while seated when Allah (SWT) says: And when they see some merchandise or some amusement they disperse headlong to it"""
"1398","It was narrated from Aws bin Aws Ath-Thaqafi that :The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \\""Whoever washes (ghassala) and performs ghusl"""
"1399","It was narrated from Abu Az-Zahiriyah about 'Abdullah bin Busr"
"1400","Amr bin Dinar narrated that:He heard Jabir bin 'Abdullah say: \\""A man came when the Prophet (ﷺ) was on the minbar on a Friday. He said to him: 'Have you prayed two rak'ahs?' He said: 'No.' He said: 'Pray"""
"1401","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that:The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \\""Whoever says to his companion on Friday"""
"1402","It was narrated from 'Abdullah bin Ibrahim bin Qariz and Sa'eed bin Al-Musayyab that:Abu Hurairah said: \\""I heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) say: 'If you say to your companion: Listen attentively on a Friday when the Imam is delivering the khutbah"""
"1403","It was narrated that Salman said:\\""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said to me: 'There is no man who purifies himself on Friday as he is commanded"""
"1404","It was narrated from 'Abdullah:\\""The Prophet (ﷺ) taught us Khutbat Al-Hajah: Alhamduu lillahi nasta'inuhu wa nastagfiruhu"""
"1405","It was narrated that Ibn 'Umar said:\\""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) delivered a khutbah and said: 'When any one of you wants to go to Jumu'ah"""
"1406","It was narrated from Ibrahim bin Nashit that:He asked Ibn Shihab about ghusl on Friday. He said: \\""It is a sunnah; Salim bin 'Abdullah told me"""
"1407","It was narrated from 'Abdullah bin 'Abdullah (from 'Abdullah) Ibn 'Umar that:While he was standing on the minbar"
"1408","It was narrated that Iyad bin 'Abdullah said:\\""I heard Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri say: 'A man who appeared shabbily came on a Friday"""
"1409","It was narrated from Jabir bin 'Abdullah who said:\\""While the Prophet (ﷺ) was delivering the khutbah on Friday"""
"1410","Abu Bakrah said:\\""I saw the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) on the Minbar"""
"1411","It was narrated from Muhammad bin 'Abdur-Rahman that:The daughter of Harithah bin An-Nu'man said: \\""I memorized 'Qaf. By the Glorious Qur'an"""
"1412","It was narrated from Sufyan bin Husain that :Bishr bin Marwan raised his hands on Friday on the minbar"
"1413","It was narrated from 'Abdullah bin Buraidah that his father said:\\""The Prophet (ﷺ) was preaching"""
"1414","Abdullah bin Abi Awfa said:\\""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) used to recite a great deal of remembrance"""
"1415","It was narrated that Jabir bin Samurah said:\\""I sat with the Prophet (ﷺ) and I did not see him deliver the khutbah except standing"""
"1416","It was narrated from 'Abdullah that:The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) used to deliver two khutbahs standing"
"1417","It was narrated that Jabir bin Samurah said:\\""I saw the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) delivering the khutbah on Friday standing"""
"1418","It was narrated that Jabir bin Samurah said:\\""The Prophet (ﷺ) used to deliver the khutbah standing"""
"1419","It was narrated that Anas said:\\""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) would come down from the minbar and a man would come to him and speak to him"""
"1420","It was narrated from 'Abdur-Rahman bin Abi Laila that 'Umar said:\\""Jumu'ah prayer is two rak'ahs"""
"1421","It was narrated from Ibn 'Abbas that :During the Subh prayer on Friday"
"1422","It was narrated that Samurah said:\\""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) used to recite in Jumu'ah prayer: 'Glorify the Name of your Lord"""
"1423","Ad-Dahhak bin Qais asked An-Nu'man bin Bashir:\\""What did the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) use to recite on Friday after Surat Al-Jumu'ah?\""\"" He said: \""\""He used to recite: 'Has there come to you the narration of the overwhelming (i.e. the Day of Resurrection)?'\""\"" (Al-Ghashiyah)"""
"1424","It was narrated that An-Nu'man bin Bashir said:\\""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) used to recite 'Glorify the name of your Lord"""
"1425","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that:The Prophet (ﷺ) said: \\""Whoever catches up with a rak'ah of Jumu'ah prayer has caught up with it"""
"1426","It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\\""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: 'When any one of you prays Jumu'ah let him pray four (rak'ahs) after that"""
"1427","It was narrated from Ibn 'Umar that:The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) would not pray after Jumu'ah until he had left"
"1428","It was narrated from Salim that his father said:\\""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) used to pray two rak'ahs in his house after Jumu'ah"""
"1429","It was narrated from Ibn 'Umar that he used to pray two rak'ahs after Jumu'ah"
"1430","It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\\""I went out to At-Tur and met Ka'b. He and I spent a day together"""
"1431","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that:The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \\""On Friday"""
"1432","It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\\""Abu Al-Qasim (ﷺ) said: 'On Friday"""
